{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2c897914f6d1e664","name":"Miy'til Assault Bomber","source":{"id":"source:reference-2c897914f6d1e664","title":"Miy'til Assault Bomber","revision":18754,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:40:35Z","sha256":"1ca320024472e452cd3fd1688e14393c681ceab35bd3753be66370d481067bda","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18754","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Miy%27til%20Assault%20Bomber&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2c897914f6d1e664","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hapes Consortium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hapes_Consortium","referenceId":"reference:91b0af29e731ba94"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["To satisfy military planners who argued that a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," couldn't do everything, the designers at Olanji/Charubah built the heavier, larger Miy'til Assault Bomber. However, a successful design and political support isn't always enough to turn a design into an effective fleet. Though the Miy'til Assault Bomber is a magnificent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},", especially in its primary mission of direct assault, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hapes Consortium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hapes_Consortium","referenceId":"reference:91b0af29e731ba94"}," doesn't have the spare manufacturing capacity to build enough Miy'til Assault Bombers to meet its military needs. Though not unreasonably expensive individually, the new Starfighters can't be built in the same slips as the standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Miy'til Fighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Miy%27til_Fighter"},". As a result, only one shipyard slip has been reconfigured for Assault Bomber construction, resulting in low overall numbers.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One benefit of smaller numbers is the increased ease of keeping them secret. No one outside the Hapan military has a good idea of the exact capabilities of the Assault Bomber. They are never deployed outside the Hapes Cluster, being reserved for home defense and generally stationed only on the most renowned ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hapan Battle Dragons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hapan_Battle_Dragons"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Slower, shorter-ranged, and requiring more support, the Miy'til Assault Bomber is intended to be put into use only when a heavy assault (generally against large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},") is called for. The bombers must be carried into battle, and they are equipped with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrives"}," only for very short-range hyperspace jumps prior to an attack and as an emergency escape option.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though there's nothing revolutionary about the Miy'til Assault Bomber, it does a simple thing very well. With the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," controlling the Starfighter's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," is free to focus on where to place missiles to do the most damage. With an impressive payload for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},", a Miy'til Assault Bomber can hammer at large targets numerous times, to either help weaken shields or finish off ships already exposed to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolaser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolaser","referenceId":"reference:3f6c338dc202fcde"}," fire from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hapan Battle Dragons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hapan_Battle_Dragons"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Miy'til Assault Bomber Statistics (CL 11)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 17 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 27; +8 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 120; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 10; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 30; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Da